                                                "sense_id": "19a60854-9cc7-30b5-9bc5-47b083b7fe04",
                                                "text": "Singer Paula Elliot closed the evening's performances with a number of gospel, jazz and blues tunes. Elliot concentrated mostly on traditionals like \"Motherless Child,\" \"Nobody Knows You When You're Down and Out,\" \"God Bless the Child,\" and \"Wild Women Don't Get the Blues.\""
                                            },
